e years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 54% of normal in October to November and 156% in April to May. So far in 2026 March to April came in at 42% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21215 had its driest year in 1965 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
